   - Add event: click date > “More options” > Title (e.g., “Jasper — DOB: Apr 2, 2023”) > Make it repeat: “Does not repeat” → choose “Custom” → “Annually on Apr 2”.
   - Add notifications: choose e.g., “Email 2 weeks before” + “Notification 2 days before”.
   - Use the “Description” field for details (gift ideas, size for kids’ clothes, gift card balance).
   - Share calendar: Settings > Share with specific people.

2. Apple Calendar
   - New calendar in Calendar app or iCloud.com.
   - Add event > repeat annually > add alerts (customizable).
